{"id": "t073-001", "text": "Matteo is coeliac, properly, not just avoiding bread. He also can't stand coriander. Worth remembering before the dinner at ours on Saturday at 7.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matteo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "coeliac", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't stand coriander", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner at ours", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday at 7", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t073-002", "text": "Aditi's dad had a fall on Tuesday evening and fractured his wrist. She's driving up to Leeds tomorrow morning to stay with him for a few days. He's refusing to use the sling and her mum is apparently at the end of her tether with him. Aditi said she'll be back on Sunday night, and she'd love a walk on Monday to decompress.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday evening", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fractured his wrist", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up to Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the end of her tether", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday night", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "walk", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t073-003", "text": "Remind me to text Joe on Thursday afternoon to see how his knee scan went.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Joe", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t073-004", "text": "Kasia has gone vegan since September. Her partner Ivan hasn't, and apparently it's causing some friction at dinner time.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since September"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t073-005", "text": "Called Grace. Her little boy Theo has had a temperature since Sunday night and they're seeing the GP at 10:40 tomorrow. She sounded exhausted. I should ring her the next day to check how he is.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Grace", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "little boy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "temperature", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since Sunday night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "seeing the GP", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "10:40 tomorrow", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t073-006", "text": "Dawit only drinks oat milk flat whites and hates anything with cinnamon in it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "only drinks oat milk flat whites", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates anything with cinnamon in it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "t073-007", "text": "Stefan's mum has her hip replacement on the 14th at half 8 in the morning. He's taking the whole week off and staying with her afterwards. Don't forget to send him a message that evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th at half 8 in the morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking the whole week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him a message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t073-008", "text": "Imogen and her husband are hosting Christmas this year for both families. Her sister Mia is bringing the twins, and Mia's allergic to nuts, so Imogen is panicking about the menu.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imogen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hosting Christmas", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to nuts", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imogen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t073-009", "text": "Need to pick up my prescription before 6 on Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pick up my prescription", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before 6 on Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t073-010", "text": "Ali mentioned he's been off work with a slipped disc for nearly three weeks. He's going stir crazy at home and says the physio is the only thing keeping him sane.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "slipped disc", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "nearly three weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "going stir crazy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t073-011", "text": "Jess loves a good negroni, and she said her favourite restaurant is the little Sicilian place on Hope Street. Could be a nice birthday idea in March.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jess", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "negroni", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "little Sicilian place on Hope Street", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t073-012", "text": "Spoke to Reza after the match. His daughter Zara broke her arm at trampolining on Saturday morning. She's in a cast for six weeks and he says she's mostly upset about missing the swimming gala the week after. His wife is taking her to the fracture clinic on Friday at 9:30, and Reza's covering the school run that morning. Zara wants everyone to sign her cast.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the match"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke her arm", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in a cast", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "mostly upset", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "swimming gala", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fracture clinic", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 9:30", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants everyone to sign her cast", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t073-013", "text": "Gareth's wedding tasting is on Wednesday at 2pm. He and Petra still can't agree on the cake; she wants lemon, he wants chocolate.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding tasting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday at 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petra", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t073-014", "text": "Must ask Liam how his dad's heart check went on Monday morning.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Liam how his dad's heart check went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "heart check", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t073-015", "text": "Svetlana doesn't drink at all, so get some decent alcohol-free fizz in for the party.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Svetlana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get some decent alcohol-free fizz in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t073-016", "text": "Chioma's mum is in hospital again with her chest. Chioma is flying to Lagos on the 3rd, first thing in the morning, and won't be back until the 17th. She's quite worried but trying to keep it together. Her brother is already there and sending updates. Remind me to message her on the 4th once she's landed and settled, and again the day before she flies home.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Lagos", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd, first thing in the morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the 17th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to keep it together", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 4th", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "once she's landed and settled", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies home", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t073-017", "text": "Had lunch with Siddharth and Saanvi. They've both cut out sugar for a month as a challenge. Saanvi is doing much better at it than he is, and she wouldn't let him forget it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siddharth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saanvi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cut out sugar", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saanvi", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t073-018", "text": "Lorenzo's dinner party next Friday is off because his flatmate has Covid. He'll reschedule for the week after, probably the Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lorenzo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Covid", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "probably the Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t073-019", "text": "I'm doing the dessert for Marta's birthday lunch on Sunday at 1. Remember she can't have dairy, so it'll have to be the sorbet again.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marta", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday at 1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't have dairy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t073-020", "text": "Gintaras has been struggling since his surgery. The wound got infected and he's back on antibiotics until the 22nd. Remind me to pop round with some soup on Thursday evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gintaras", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "on antibiotics", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the 22nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pop round with some soup", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t073-021", "text": "Jaya told me her son Arjun has glandular fever. He's missed two weeks of college and she's worried he'll fall behind before his mocks in January.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "glandular fever", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "college", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mocks", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t073-022", "text": "Samir's big presentation is Monday at 9am and he's really nervous about it. Text him good luck on Sunday night, then ask how it went that afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big presentation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday at 9am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday night", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t073-023", "text": "Dong said his wife is expecting again, due in early April. She's had terrible morning sickness this time round. He's being very sweet about it all, doing every school run and cooking all the meals because she can't face the smell of onions. Their eldest, Ali, is excited about being a big brother.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrible morning sickness", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't face the smell of onions", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t073-024", "text": "Aidan and Julien are off to Lisbon on the 9th. Aidan is pescatarian, Julien will eat literally anything. They fly back the following Tuesday. Julien's mum is house-sitting and looking after their cat Pesto while they're away. Aidan asked me to recommend somewhere for seafood, so I should send him that list from my trip.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 9th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pescatarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "will eat literally anything", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the following Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pesto", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "while they're away", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him that list from my trip", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t073-025", "text": "Need to book the car in for its MOT before the end of the month, ideally a Saturday morning.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book the car in for its MOT", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the end of the month", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "ideally a Saturday morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t073-026", "text": "Sadia's dog Biscuit had to have a tooth out yesterday. She was more stressed than Biscuit was. The vet wants to see him again a week after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tooth out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week after", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t073-027", "text": "Mia's brother Ivan has just been diagnosed with type 1 diabetes. He's twenty-four and finding it a lot to take in. Mia is going over to his on Saturday to help him sort out his meals. Their mum keeps ringing him three times a day, which isn't helping. Mia thinks a cookbook for diabetics might be a nice thing to give him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "type 1 diabetes", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "twenty-four", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "finding it a lot to take in", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going over to his", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "cookbook for diabetics", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t073-028", "text": "Joe Murphy's retirement do is on the 28th at 7 at the cricket club. His wife is organising it and has asked everyone to keep it quiet. I should chip in for the card and the gift.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe Murphy", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retirement do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 28th at 7", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "chip in for the card and the gift", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t073-029", "text": "Matteo said his partner Aditi is gluten free too, so they're the easiest couple to cook for. Both love spicy food, the hotter the better.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matteo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "gluten free", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "spicy food", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t073-030", "text": "Quick note: Stefan prefers red wine, Gareth only drinks lager, and Petra is teetotal.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "prefers red wine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "only drinks lager", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petra", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "teetotal", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t073-031", "text": "Grace called back. Theo's temperature finally broke last night and he went back to nursery this morning. Huge relief.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Grace", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "temperature", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Huge relief", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t073-032", "text": "Kasia's grandma passed away on Sunday. The funeral is in Kraków on the 30th and she's flying out the day before with her brother Marek. Send her a card this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandma", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 30th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marek", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send her a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t073-033", "text": "Remind me to ask Dawit whether his sister got the results from her blood tests.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Dawit whether his sister got the results from her blood tests", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "blood tests", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t073-034", "text": "Zara's ninth birthday party is the Saturday after next, from 2 till 4. She's obsessed with axolotls at the moment, so anything axolotl themed would be perfect.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ninth birthday party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday after next, from 2 till 4", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "axolotls", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anything axolotl themed would be perfect", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t073-035", "text": "Saw Ali at the pharmacy this morning. He's finally starting back at work on Monday, but only half days for the first fortnight.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starting back at work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t073-036", "text": "Imogen is off caffeine because of her migraines. She said decaf is fine but only before lunch, oddly.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imogen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "off caffeine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "migraines", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "decaf is fine but only before lunch", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t073-037", "text": "Reza's wife Svetlana Reyes starts chemotherapy on Thursday at 11. Reza says she's being very calm about it, but he's not sleeping. Their kids don't fully understand what's happening yet. I must check in with him the day after and offer to take the kids one evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Svetlana Reyes", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chemotherapy", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "calm", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sleeping", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to take the kids", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "one evening", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t073-038", "text": "Julien is cooking a full French dinner for his parents' anniversary on the 18th. Forty years married. He's been practising the beef bourguignon every weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "anniversary", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Forty years married", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "relationship"}]}
{"id": "t073-039", "text": "I'm taking Svetlana to her eye appointment on Wednesday at 3:15, so I'll need to leave work early.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Svetlana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "eye appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday at 3:15", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "leave work early", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}]}
{"id": "t073-040", "text": "Jess's partner Samir has been signed off with stress for a month. She's holding everything together with the kids, and I think she's struggling more than she lets on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jess", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samir", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "signed off with stress", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "holding everything together", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t073-041", "text": "Lorenzo hates mushrooms with a passion. Do not put them in anything.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lorenzo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates mushrooms", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "t073-042", "text": "Liam's dad is home from hospital now. The doctors want him back for a follow-up scan on the 2nd in the morning. Liam's going with him and then working from home that afternoon. His mum wants a quiet Sunday lunch for the family the weekend after, and Liam said his dad is already demanding roast potatoes despite the new low-salt diet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "home from hospital", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "follow-up scan", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd in the morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quiet Sunday lunch", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "low-salt diet", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t073-043", "text": "Chatted to Petra on the phone for ages. Her daughter Lily got into the county youth orchestra, and her son has chickenpox, so the house is equal parts celebration and calamine lotion.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petra", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lily", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the county youth orchestra", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chickenpox", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t073-044", "text": "Siddharth (Sid to everyone) has a nut allergy, the serious EpiPen kind. Check the bakery labels before ordering the cake for his leaving drinks on Friday at 5.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siddharth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sid", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nut allergy, the serious EpiPen kind", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check the bakery labels", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before ordering the cake", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 5", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t073-045", "text": "Must buy more coffee and bin bags.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "buy more coffee and bin bags", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t073-046", "text": "Gareth said his brother Dylan's stag weekend in Dublin has been cancelled because the best man broke his leg. They might just do a curry instead. Dylan is gutted, but honestly I think he's relieved not to fly. The wedding itself is still on for the 23rd of November at 1pm, and Gareth is doing a reading, which he's dreading.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dylan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "best man", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke his leg", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "curry", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dylan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 23rd of November at 1pm", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "reading", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t073-047", "text": "Don't forget to ask Marta how her mum's cataract operation went. It was this morning at 10.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Marta how her mum's cataract operation went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marta", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cataract operation", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning at 10", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t073-048", "text": "Saanvi is training for the Cardiff half marathon on the 5th. She's carb loading the two days before and has banned me from tempting her with cake until afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saanvi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Cardiff half marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 5th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the two days before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t073-049", "text": "Aidan hasn't been himself lately. His mum's dementia is getting worse and he's going to see her every Sunday afternoon now. He said he'd like to get out for a pint sometime, so I should invite him for Thursday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hasn't been himself", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "lately"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dementia", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every Sunday afternoon"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite him", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t073-050", "text": "Dong Zhou's kids both have norovirus. The whole family is cancelling the trip to his in-laws this weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong Zhou", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "norovirus", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "in-laws", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend"}]}
