{"id": "t073-052", "text": "Plan for Saturday: gym at 8, farmers market afterwards, then batch cook for the week.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "gym", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "8", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "farmers market", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "batch cook", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t073-053", "text": "Remind me to send Sadia the recipe for that lentil soup tomorrow evening. She's been trying to eat more plant-based since her cholesterol results.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Sadia the recipe for that lentil soup", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to eat more plant-based", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cholesterol results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t073-054", "text": "Ivan Petrov twisted his ankle playing five-a-side on Tuesday night. He's on crutches and furious about missing the derby on the 12th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan Petrov", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "twisted his ankle", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "five-a-side", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "on crutches", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "furious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "derby", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t073-055", "text": "Jaya and her husband are both on a low-FODMAP diet for his IBS. She says it's made them both miserable but his stomach is much better.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "low-FODMAP diet", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "IBS", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "miserable", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t073-056", "text": "Gintaras is a whisky man, specifically Islay. He said he'd love a bottle of Lagavulin one day, which is a good hint for his fortieth in December.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gintaras", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "whisky", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Islay", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a bottle of Lagavulin", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fortieth", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in December", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t073-057", "text": "Had coffee with Kasia and Zara this morning. Zara's mum is in hospital with pneumonia and Kasia is covering her shifts all week. Zara's visiting her each evening after work. Kasia is going in on Friday at 6 too. I need to message Zara on Saturday morning to see how her mum is doing, and maybe drop off some food the day after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pneumonia", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "all week"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "each evening after work"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 6"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message Zara", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off some food", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t073-058", "text": "Mia's partner Julien is lactose intolerant, but he still orders the cheese board every single time.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "lactose intolerant", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "cheese board", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t073-059", "text": "Dawit's sister got the all clear from her blood tests. He was so relieved he bought a round for the whole table.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "all clear", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
